SUMMARY:Cue the Girls - Community Night
DESCRIPTION:You’ve always got a Friend at West End — let us introduce you to some more! Let Friends of a Friend social group help you break the ice and meet some new folks. Whether you’ve been playing pool for years or you’re just here for the vibes\, this one’s for the girls (gays\, theys\, and allies all included) looking to get out\, meet new people\, and have a good time. \nPull up solo or bring a friend — FOF will handle the introductions. Expect pool\, laughs\, drinks\, and a night full of genuine connections. Beats will be provided by DJ Desipher and DJ Smileez.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/cue-the-girls-community-night/2026-08-21/
LOCATION:West End Billiards\, 601 W. Main St.\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Dance,DJ,LGBTQ,Mixers and Parties,Wines, Spirits, Beer and Cheer
