SUMMARY:THE LONG EXHALE | A GROUP EXHIBITION
DESCRIPTION:5 Points Gallery is pleased to present The Long Exhale\, bringing together work by the ten artists of 5 Points Gallery. As the pace of summer begins to soften\, The Long Exhale invites visitors to pause\, look closely\, and linger. The exhibition offers a refreshing mix of painting\, sculpture\, fused glass\, mixed media\, and finely crafted furniture\, with each artist offering a distinct creative perspective. Join us for the Opening Reception on Friday\, August 21\, 2026\, from 6–9 pm to meet the artists. The exhibition runs from August 20 through September 12\, 2026. \nVisit 5 Points Gallery in person or online at https://5pointsgallery.com. All work from the exhibition is available for shipping or pickup. Gallery hours: Thursdays and Fridays 5–9pm and Saturdays 1–9pm. Artists are available to talk about their work. For a private viewing\, contact us at info@5pointsgallery.com.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/the-long-exhale-a-group-exhibition/2026-08-21/
LOCATION:5 Points Gallery\, 109 E Chapel Hill St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,Date Night,Exhibit,Free,Third Friday
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/The-Long-Exhale-5-Points-Gallery.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="5 points":MAILTO:info@5pointsgallery.com
GEO:35.9970428;-78.9034674
