SUMMARY:Live Music at ATC
DESCRIPTION:Live at Bay 7 is teaming up with American Tobacco Campus to bring you live music on Friday nights this summer from a range of local artists and styles\, including jazz\, bluegrass\, rock and more. These shows are free\, open to the public\, and kid-friendly. \nWe’ll set up near the water tower\, so feel free to bring blankets and lawn chairs\, get something to eat and drink from any of the restaurants at ATC\, and enjoy\nlive music under a setting sun. \nUpcoming shows below\, and check americantobacco.co/events for updates… \nAugust 14 – AZUL\, 7-9pm\n\nAugust 21 – The Velvet Beat\, 6:30-8:30pm (no change)\n\nAugust 28 – Los Husbandos\, 6:30-8:30 (rescheduled from August 14)
