SUMMARY:The Burrow's Grand Opening
DESCRIPTION:Come by and check out your new neighborhood Vintage & Secondhand clothing store! On August 21st we’ll be open from 12-7pm\, after we’re having a Grand Opening celebration from 7-9pm. We’ll have music from DJ Big Lyd\, refreshments and Giveaways! That Saturday and Sunday we’re also having a 20% Off Sale (8/22\,8/23) \nAlso opening that day is Aldo’s Thrift Shoppe! Located at 311 w Corporation St\, Durham NC 27701\nEverything is $20 or Less!
