SUMMARY:Flux & Drift 05: Rulette @ Future Hooman
DESCRIPTION:Don’t miss this one\, it’s gonna be a game changer 🙃 \nAre you a rule follower or a rule breaker? Play a game with us and find out…or just come for the party! We’ll have live music and light snacks and drinks. Explore the exhibit and chat with other interesting folks. Party starts at 7pm and runs til we get tired and go home. Feel free to drop by any time before 10pm.\nA suggested donation of $5 to $20 helps us build new exhibits\, host more happenings\, and keep this little experiment growing.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/flux-drift-05-rulette-future-hooman/
