SUMMARY:Keep It A Bean: One Year at The Durham
DESCRIPTION:Keep It A Bean has spent the past year building its café culture\, curated playlists\, and Friday-night crowd right here in Durham. This is the one-year mark. Join us at The Durham for an evening of laid-back vibes featuring a curated DJ set\, local vendors\, rooftop views\, specialty coffee\, classic cocktails\, and the community that has made Keep It A Bean such a staple. \nWhether you’ve been with us since the beginning or you’re joining for the first time\, this anniversary party is the perfect opportunity to experience what Keep It A Bean is all about. \nDJ Zakee is on the decks for the full four hours. Middle of May Vintage Clothing and Coogi Mamaa Cosmetics are set up with racks and product for the night. \nNo cover\, no reservation required. The Roof is open to the public 5 PM–12 AM regardless of RSVP
