SUMMARY:Run For Refugees
DESCRIPTION:Lace up your running shoes and join World Relief Durham for the 3rd annual Run for Refugees 5K on Saturday\, August 22! \nRunners\, walkers\, families and community members of all ages are invited to come together for a fun morning at Miracle Park celebrating the rich diversity of the Triangle and supporting refugees and immigrant families building new lives in our community. \nThe professionally timed 5K begins at 9:00 a.m. and follows the American Tobacco Trail. Stick around before and after the race to connect with local businesses\, vendors and community members. \nWhether you’re chasing a personal best\, walking with friends and family\, or simply looking for a meaningful way to spend your Saturday morning\, every step makes a difference. \n📍 Miracle Park\, 473 Morehead Ave.\, Durham\n📅 Saturday\, August 22\, 2026\n⏰ Race starts at 9:00 a.m. \nChildren ages 5 and under can participate for free with a registered adult.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/run-for-refugees/
LOCATION:Miracle League of the Triangle\, 473 Morehead Ave\,\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Sports
