SUMMARY:Intermediate Stained Glass: Experience Required\, Fall Themes
DESCRIPTION:This is a three-hour class in which students will build on the basics of the copper foil or “Tiffany” method of creating stained glass. This process includes cutting\, grinding\, foiling\, and soldering individual glass pieces. Students will also learn to work with tinned copper wire to create fine details and flourishes. All materials are included in class pricing.
