SUMMARY:Nitro Circus 2.0
DESCRIPTION:Nitro Circus Live is BACK — bigger\, wilder\, and more extreme than ever! Experience the world’s best FMX\, BMX\, scooter\, and stunt athletes throwing down jaw‑dropping tricks\, world‑first moments\, and hilarious contraptions off the legendary Giganta Ramp. \nThis year’s show features:\n—Adam Jones attempting a historic 75‑ft backflip through a 35‑ft wall of fire\n—Ryan Bean diving 40 ft into just 3.5 ft of water\n—Cody Matechuk launching a snowmobile off the brand‑new Levi Ramp—no snow required\n—Fan‑favorite contraptions making their chaotic return with outrageous new surprises \nDon’t miss an unforgettable night of high‑flying chaos\, record‑breaking stunts\, and all‑new action.\nNever Been Done. Never Been Seen. Absolutely Unreal. \nYou Gotta See It to Believe It. Grab your tickets now at NitroCircus.com!
